---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A little about Frank Trout and this blog."
	pubDate={new Date('June 06 2026')}
>
	<img class="avatar" src="/profile.jpg" alt="Frank Trout" width="160" height="160" />

	<p>
		Hi, I'm Frank Trout. I build and write about production-ready AI agents — the part of the
		work that happens after the demo, when something actually has to ship, stay secure, and scale.
	</p>

	<style>
		.avatar {
			width: 160px;
			height: 160px;
			border-radius: 50%;
			object-fit: cover;
			border: 1px solid rgb(var(--border));
			margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
		}
	</style>

	<p>
		This blog is where I collect field notes from that work: deployment and operational hygiene,
		identity and least-privilege design, observability and evaluation, and the responsible-AI
		practices that keep agentic systems trustworthy. Expect practical, opinionated write-ups
		grounded in real platforms and real trade-offs.
	</p>

	<p>
		You can find my code on <a href="https://github.com/ftrout">GitHub</a> or
		<a href="/rss.xml">subscribe to the blog via RSS</a>. Thanks for reading.
	</p>

	<!-- TODO: Personalize this further — add your background, current role, and contact links. -->
</Layout>
